<title>USA: Northland Cranberries buys Wisconsin farm.</title>
<headline>Northland Cranberries buys Wisconsin farm.</headline>
<dateline>WISCONSIN RAPIDS, Wis. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northland Cranberries Inc said it completed its acquisition of a 170-acre cranberry property in northern Wisconsin from John E. McFarland and Sons Inc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>The purchase increases Northland's total number of cranberry marshes owned in the state of Wisconsin to 20.</p>
<p>The company said it also operates four cranberry properties in Massachusetts.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
